# Album Proofer design system

Full reference: `docs/ALBUM_PROOFER_DESIGN.md` and README §15.

## Palette tokens (`src/styles/typography.css`)

Use these CSS variables — do not invent sky blue / cyan accents for Album Proofer chrome.

| Token | Hex | Use |
|---|---|---|
| `--canvas` | `#f7f6f2` | Page ground (`--bg` alias) |
| `--surface` | `#ffffff` | Cards, panels |
| `--surface-sunk` | `#f0efeb` | Inputs, wells |
| `--ink` | `#1d1916` | Titles |
| `--ink-body` | `#44403c` | Body |
| `--ink-muted` | `#857f7b` | Secondary |
| `--accent` | `#bf7b47` | Marks, rings |
| `--accent-text` | `#a86c3c` | Links |
| `--ok-fg` | `#597f5d` | Approved |
| `--warn-fg` | `#997735` | Needs you / amber statuses |
| `--idle-fg` | `#8a8580` | Draft / paused |
| `--stop-fg` | `#8d3a32` | Destructive only |
| `--proof-surround` | `#ebeae6` | Proof canvas surround |

## Status vocabulary — exact words everywhere

| Label | Tone | Colour |
|---|---|---|
| Draft | `draft` | Idle grey |
| Not opened | `awaiting` | Amber |
| Awaiting feedback | `feedback` | Amber |
| Revision requested | `revision` | Amber (**never red**) |
| Approved | `approved` | Green |
| Paused | `paused` | Idle grey |

**Revision requested is amber, not red.** Client engagement is a healthy product state — red trains photographers to feel failure when the product is working.

Blank-cover leather swatches must not include sky blue / turquoise. Default leather: `cream`.
